svg.title:
final class FeedbackControl {
    static double angleRadians(
            long ticks, int ticksPerTurn) {
        if (ticksPerTurn <= 0)
            throw new IllegalArgumentException();
        return ticks * (2.0 * Math.PI / ticksPerTurn);
    }

    static double proportional(
            double target, double measured,
            double gain) {
        return gain * (target - measured);
    }
} Incoming systems engineering co-op, space and infrastructure at RTX / Raytheon. Building at ND DOT / UGPTI. NDSU Computer Science, class of 2027.
